{"abstract":[{"text":"Define the minimum version of the swift compiler required for your package.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs/SettingSwiftToolsVersion"},"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swift Package Manager"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Setting the Swift tools version"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tools version declares the minimum version of the Swift compiler required to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use the package, as well as how parse the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" manifest.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"When you create a new package using ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs/PackageInit","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", the minimum version is set automatically to the current version.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The version is specified on the first line of the manifest with the comment ","type":"text"},{"code":"// swift-tools-version:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the version for the Swift compiler.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The version is a semantic version, with the exception that a patch version is inferred to be ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if you don’t specify it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, the following line asserts the package requires the Swift compiler version 6.1 or later:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["// swift-tools-version:6.1"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Resolving-dependencies-with-different-tools-versions","level":3,"text":"Resolving dependencies with different tools versions","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When resolving package dependencies, if the tools version of a dependency is greater than the version in use, that version of the dependency is ineligible and dependency resolution continues with evaluating the next-best version.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If no tools version of a dependency, which otherwise meets the package version requirements, supports the version of the Swift tools in use, the package manager presents a dependency resolution error.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For more information on providing package manifests for specific Swift versions, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs/SwiftVersionSpecificPackaging","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Adjusting-the-tools-version","level":3,"text":"Adjusting the tools version.","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Edit the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to adjust the version, or use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs/PackageToolsVersion","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to report or set the the tools version.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Building-Packages","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs/CreatingSwiftPackage","doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs/UsingBuildConfigurations","doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs/SwiftVersionSpecificPackaging","doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs/BundlingResources","doc://PackageManagerDocs/documentation/PackageManagerDocs/Relea